go-diceware embeds two wordlists that are not covered by this project's MIT
licence.

English: the EFF large wordlist for random passphrases
(internal/wordlist/eff_large_wordlist.txt), by the Electronic Frontier
Foundation, published at
https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/07/new-wordlists-random-passphrases
under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/). The list is used as
published.

Romanian: internal/wordlist/ro_diceware.txt is generated by
scripts/genro from two sources; see that directory for the exact steps.

  * The Romanian Wikipedia dump of 2026-11-01
    (https://dumps.wikimedia.org/rowiki/20261101/rowiki-20261101-pages-articles.xml.bz2,
    sha256 4ee430544beb0d61290748d48d75dcccc8e166906dcda4fcbd83580db1e77394),
    text by the Wikipedia contributors under CC BY-SA 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Only how often each
    word occurs is used (scripts/genro/counts.tsv); no text is copied.

  * The rospell Romanian dictionary 3.3.10 (http://rospell.sourceforge.net),
    Copyright (C) 2005-2013 Rospell Team, used under the Mozilla Public
    License 1.1 of its GPL 2.0 / LGPL 2.1 / MPL 1.1 tri-licence. It is used
    only to decide which words are Romanian base forms.

The earlier Romanian list, from https://github.com/danciu/diceware.ro
(GPL-3.0), was replaced by this one in the version after 0.3.0 and is no
longer part of go-diceware.
